(text_box "HX711 DOUT pins split (3/0/1) and shared SCK (2); AO3400A orientation fixed; 12V input rebuilt for 14 A: ATO blade-fuse holder F1 + AON6407 reverse protection + J16 24 A terminal; decoupling and netclasses added; E-stop valve cut (Q10) + sense; HX711 RATE jumpers (80 SPS); 4x M3 mounting holes; F1 changed from SMD fuse to Littelfuse 178.6165 ATO holder (20 A blade fuse user supplied); docs set" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 88.000 146.060 0) (size 330.000 7.200) (margins 0.7 0.3 0.7 0.3) (stroke (width 0.1524) (type solid)) (fill (type none)) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left top)) (uuid "484645f8-9029-4893-9abc-ad2fbb46202c"))
(text "GENERAL NOTES" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 14.000 159.260 0) (effects (font (size 2.2 2.2) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "a36c08ac-78d5-4834-b68b-3ff55e7f2c7a"))
(text "1. All dimensions in mm. Board drawing on sheet 8 is 1:1." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 14.000 162.260 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "e22e81dd-b1a0-4b54-8a5b-a9a631573453"))
(text "2. Wire colours on sheets 4-5 are the colour convention for this rig (pressure: red +5V / black GND / green SIG; load cell: red / black / green / white)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 14.000 166.460 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "000edad1-f2d9-4ea3-9907-90e94791a5b5"))
(text "3. J1-J15, J17-J31 are Phoenix MPT 0,5 (2.54 mm) terminals: max 0.5 mm2 (20 AWG) wire. Use ferrules or a pigtail for thicker valve leads." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 14.000 170.660 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "4cdf8d36-afb0-4a3c-8ad8-677b27799e9b"))
(text "4. J16 (12 V input) accepts up to 4 mm2 (12 AWG). Use >= 14 AWG for the 15 A supply lead and keep it short." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 14.000 174.860 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "f194538a-b4d5-499d-a716-0d0fe55118d7"))
(text "5. Teensy 4.1 is hand-soldered on headers and is not part of the JLCPCB BOM. Cut the VIN-VUSB pad on the Teensy underside before powering from D9." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 14.000 179.060 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "f1e9f3c9-92b7-4f24-ac0f-5a3b75ecbdee"))
(text "6. Q8 and Q10 are DFN 5x6 parts; verify pin-1 orientation in the JLCPCB CPL preview before ordering." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 14.000 183.260 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "ddcc8099-4341-4f0d-816b-ade1a55a93b0"))
(text "7. F1 is a Littelfuse 178.6165.0002 ATO/ATC holder (LCSC C207061, JLC THT/Extended). The 20 A ATO blade fuse is user supplied and is not in the BOM; fit it after assembly." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 14.000 187.460 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "dd6e2744-7e20-4dc9-a860-2198a3398a39"))
